# Uploaded to Vercel on `vercel deploy`. Nothing here is needed to build the
# app, and the handoff reference in particular is a read-only comparison copy
# that only the equivalence test imports.
#
# Leading slashes matter: a bare `supabase/` matches any directory of that name
# at any depth, which silently excluded src/lib/supabase/ and broke the build
# with "Can't resolve '@/lib/supabase/server'".
/design_handoff_capital_call_engine 2/
/supabase/
/samples/
/.claude/
